# Agent Execution (Cursor)

1. **Always** read and follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before acting.
2. **Orchestrated runs** (user invokes an AI Dev Office role or work is under `ai-dev-office/runs/<TASK_ID>/`):
